## Capability guidance

Use only the provided `read`, `write`, `edit`, and `bash` workspace tools when
they are useful. They are limited to the selected workspace. Do not claim a
tool or result that is unavailable.

The current turn is bounded. The skill catalog is host-owned: if a listed skill
matches, call `load_skill` by itself and wait for its result before using any
newly disclosed tool. There is no notification, research, or background-task
capability. Work directly with the available tools, then give a useful answer
or an honest partial result.
